/* About */
"Hi friend," = "Hola, amigo,";
"By PK" = "Por PK";
"MIT License" = "Licencia MIT";
"Thanks for being part of this." = "Gracias por ser parte de esto.";
"PKwindowsManagement was born from a simple frustration: managing windows and launching apps without cluttering the screen." = "PKwindowsManagement nació de una frustración simple: gestionar ventanas y abrir apps sin llenar la pantalla.";
"Window snapping, compact or fullscreen launchpad, script snippets, app shortcuts — all from the keyboard, without leaving your flow. Multi-display, native binary, zero dependencies." = "Ajuste de ventanas, launchpad compacto o a pantalla completa, snippets de scripts, atajos de apps: todo desde el teclado, sin salir de tu flujo. Multi pantalla, binario nativo, cero dependencias.";
"Built with care for the Mac community. Unobtrusive when you don't need it, there when you look at it." = "Creado con cariño para la comunidad Mac. Discreto cuando no lo necesitas, presente cuando lo miras.";

